## Workflow Reference
Implements: ai_toolkit/workflows/feature-delivery/make-plan.md

# Make plan

**Follow the workflow file verbatim.** Specs only — no app code, no Cursor plan.

## Args

```text
<feature|plan-path> [phase|next] [+tag -tag] [--load=a,b] [--full] [--commit]
```

`phase` / `next` unused. **Commit:** false unless `--commit` (then ask). `--no-commits` = default.

## Load (once; skip missing; no indexes)

1. `ai_toolkit/workflows/feature-delivery/make-plan.md`
2. LOADMAP cards for tags / `--full`
3. `ai_specs/brd/features/<feature>.md`
4. `ai_specs/design/features/<feature>.md` + named screens
5. `ai_specs/api/features/<feature>/`
6. `ai_specs/api/contracts/INDEX.md` rows for this slug
7. `ai_docs/architecture.md`, `ai_docs/conventions.md` when present
8. Existing feature `README.md`

Every phase gets `Load`, `Inputs`, `Touches`, `Effort`. Coverage: every requirement, endpoint, and screen maps to a phase. Missing contract → `/backend-contract request <feature> [topic]` — do not invent. Create `memory.md` from `ai_toolkit/templates/specs/feature-memory.md` when missing (empty sections, ≤ 3 KB). If it exists, leave it — do not append.

End with exact:

```text
/feature-implement-phase <feature> next
```
